    },
    {
      "Context": "Adv.question:0",
      "Original": "Which type of bath?",
      "Vietnamese": ""
    },
    {
      "Context": "Adv.question:1",
      "Original": "Open-air hot springs|Sauna|Jacuzzi",
      "Vietnamese": ""
    },
    {
      "Key": "VC_ActivityAtMiemie_00001_RKayamori",
      "Context": "Adv.kayamoriTalk:0",
      "Original": "(This is different from usual, so it feels kinda exciting...)",
      "Vietnamese": ""
    },
    {
      "Key": "VC_ActivityAtMiemie_00002_RKayamori",
      "Context": "Adv.kayamoriTalk:0",
      "Original": "(I feel so free with the big wide sky right above.)",
      "Vietnamese": ""
    },
    {
      "Key": "VC_ActivityAtMiemie_00003_RKayamori",
      "Context": "Adv.kayamoriTalk:0",
      "Original": "(Ahh...all of that pent-up stress and fatigue is just melting away...)",
      "Vietnamese": ""
    },
    {
      "Key": "VC_ActivityAtMiemie_00004_RKayamori",
      "Context": "Adv.kayamoriTalk:0",
      "Original": "Whew...this feels amazing.",
      "Vietnamese": ""
    },
    {
      "Key": "VC_ActivityAtMiemie_00005_RKayamori",
      "Context": "Adv.kayamoriTalk:0",
      "Original": "(I hear it's good for your health to sweat it out in the sauna.)",
      "Vietnamese": ""
    },
    {
      "Key": "VC_ActivityAtMiemie_00006_RKayamori",
      "Context": "Adv.kayamoriTalk:0",
      "Original": "(It's like all the bad stuff in my body is just draining out with the sweat...I'm being cleansed from the inside!)",
      "Vietnamese": ""
    },
    {
      "Key": "VC_ActivityAtMiemie_00007_RKayamori",
      "Context": "Adv.kayamoriTalk:0",
      "Original": "(Plus, the longer I sit, the more I feel like I'm winning in a battle against myself.)",
      "Vietnamese": ""
    },
    {
      "Key": "VC_ActivityAtMiemie_00008_RKayamori",
      "Context": "Adv.kayamoriTalk:0",
      "Original": "Whew...I'm gonna completely detox and sweat all the bad stuff out!",
      "Vietnamese": ""
    },
    {
      "Key": "VC_ActivityAtMiemie_00009_NNanase",
      "Context": "Adv.talkWithIcon:1",
      "Original": "Oh. It seems there's someone already here.",
      "Vietnamese": ""
    },
    {
      "Key": "VC_ActivityAtMiemie_00010_RKayamori",
      "Context": "Adv.kayamoriTalk:0",
      "Original": "Hey Nanamin, you got some bad things writhing inside you too?",
      "Vietnamese": ""
    },
    {
      "Key": "VC_ActivityAtMiemie_00011_NNanase",
      "Context": "Adv.talkWithIcon:1",
      "Original": "Please don't phrase it like that, you make me sound like some kind of horrific creature.",
      "Vietnamese": ""
    },
    {
      "Key": "VC_ActivityAtMiemie_00012_NNanase",
      "Context": "Adv.talkWithIcon:1",
      "Original": "It's time to put water on the coals, so I came to air it with a towel.",
      "Vietnamese": ""
    },
    {
      "Key": "VC_ActivityAtMiemie_00013_RKayamori",
      "Context": "Adv.kayamoriTalk:0",
      "Original": "Not sure what that is, but go on ahead.",
      "Vietnamese": ""
    },
    {
      "Key": "VC_ActivityAtMiemie_00014_NNanase",
      "Context": "Adv.talkWithIcon:1",
      "Original": "I will proceed, then. *fwuf fwuf*",
      "Vietnamese": ""
    },
    {
      "Key": "VC_ActivityAtMiemie_00016_RKayamori",
      "Context": "Adv.kayamoriTalk:0",
      "Original": "Wooooooah! I'm sweating like crazy from this hot air!!!",
      "Vietnamese": ""
    },
    {
      "Key": "VC_ActivityAtMiemie_00017_NNanase",
      "Context": "Adv.talkWithIcon:1",
      "Original": "*fwuf fwuf*",
